- [NEXT] PROBE: GET https://ds-apip-work.threema.ch/{fetch2,identities,directory} and https://work.threema.ch/api-client/v1/{user-properties,remote-secret} (5 GETs, ≤1rps) to fingerprint live-vs-dead routes (401 vs 404 vs 405) and any header/error disclosure on the work backend before any AUTH_HELPED testing.

